---
---

<section id="about" class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-20">
  <h2 class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase" style="color: var(--color-brand);">// <span data-i18n="about.heading">Sobre mí</span></h2>
  <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-16">
    <div>
      <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl">
      <img src="/avatar2.webp" alt="About" class="w-full" style="border: 1px solid var(--border-color);" loading="lazy" />
      <div class="freedom-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <span class="freedom-quote" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;Freedom.&rdquo;</span>
    </div>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-4" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
      <p data-i18n="about.desc1">
        DevOps &amp; Software Engineer con pasaporte suizo, nacido en San Pedro de Macorís y viviendo en Jarabacoa, RD.
        Construyo aplicaciones full-stack con el stack MERN y administro infraestructura en la nube.
      </p>
      <p data-i18n="about.desc2">
        Por el día desarrollo soluciones escalables. Por la noche estoy sumergido en configuraciones de Neovim,
        optimizando mi Arch Linux Hyprland o automatizando flujos que no deberían existir.
      </p>
      <p data-i18n="about.desc3">
        Hablo TypeScript, JavaScript, Lua, Python y el idioma de los sistemas limpios y mantenibles.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-2">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold" style="color: var(--text-primary);">📍</span>
          <span class="ml-1 text-sm" data-i18n="about.label.lives">Jarabacoa, RD</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold" style="color: var(--text-primary);">🌐</span>
          <span class="ml-1 text-sm" data-i18n="about.label.languages">ES · EN (B2) · DE (A2)</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold" style="color: var(--text-primary);">💻</span>
          <span class="ml-1 text-sm" data-i18n="about.label.os">Arch Linux · Hyprland</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold" style="color: var(--text-primary);">✏️</span>
          <span class="ml-1 text-sm" data-i18n="about.label.editor">Neovim · LazyVim</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .freedom-scrim {
    position: absolute;
    inset: auto 0 0 0;
    height: 42%;
    background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.78), transparent);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .freedom-quote {
    position: absolute;
    left: 1.4rem;
    bottom: 1rem;
    z-index: 10;
    font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4.5vw, 3.1rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    transform: rotate(-4deg);
    transform-origin: left bottom;
    background: linear-gradient(100deg, var(--color-cyan) 0%, var(--color-brand) 55%, #b0152e 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
    animation: freedom-pulse 3.2s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
  }
  @keyframes freedom-pulse {
    from { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.3)) drop-shadow(0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7)); }
    to   { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 24px rgba(233, 69, 96, 0.6)) drop-shadow(0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75)); }
  }
</style>
